  "published": "2026-11-23T08:01:22.893Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking changes:\n- `IStringEnum` no longer extends `IConvertible` on any target. A struct that implements `IConvertible` declares it itself; the ISO 639 structs still do on `netstandard2.0` and `net10.0`. Code that uses an `IStringEnum` as an `IConvertible` needs a cast.\n\nFixed:\n- CodeAttributeBase.EnglishNames and FrenchNames return a copy, so changing the returned array no longer changes the attribute's names.\n- The package now includes its XML documentation, so IntelliSense shows member descriptions.",
